msgstr "重斩"

msgid "build.form.sword_primary"
msgstr "剑三连击"

msgid "build.form.sword_wave"
msgstr "剑气"

msgid "build.frost.charged_wave.description"
msgstr "右键松键发射：按住 {threshold_sec} 秒蓄满，释放宽阔寒冰月牙，造成普通剑气 {damage_percent}% 的伤害，冷却为 {cooldown_ratio} 倍；未蓄满释放普通剑气。寒冰外观本身不附加冻结。"

msgid "build.frost.charged_wave.name"
msgstr "蓄霜"

msgid "build.frost.frost_path.description"
msgstr "需要右键具备冻结能力（如冰附魔）。剑气沿途留下持续 {lifetime_sec} 秒、半径 {radius_m} 米的霜径，只减速，不冻结；分裂子体不铺路。"

msgid "build.frost.frost_path.name"
msgstr "霜径"

msgid "build.frost.ice_coat.description"
msgstr "需要右键具备冻结能力（如冰附魔）。右键实际建立冻结或 Boss 冰冻减速窗口时，获得 {shield_amount} 点护盾，持续 {duration_sec} 秒，触发间隔 {trigger_cooldown_sec} 秒。只挂冰寒或抗冻失败不触发。"

msgid "build.frost.ice_coat.name"
msgstr "冰衣"

msgid "build.frost.returning_wave.description"
msgstr "剑气到达射程或命中后折返，可再次命中；墙体会阻挡。"

msgid "build.frost.returning_wave.name"
msgstr "回锋"

msgid "build.frost.shatter_heavy.description"
msgstr "重击消费你此前施加的有效冰冻窗口（定身或Boss减速）并增伤，随后进入抗冻；不移除寒印，每次最多一个目标。"

msgid "build.frost.shatter_heavy.name"
msgstr "破冰重击"

msgid "build.frost_blast.description"
msgstr "这个动作的兼容爆炸可冻结至多 {max_targets} 个敌人 {duration_sec} 秒，包括仍存活的直击目标；遵守共享抗冻规则。"

msgid "build.frost_blast.name"
msgstr "寒霜爆破"

